{"id":786693,"title":"56｜DB-GPT多智能体协作","content":"Agent Chat是一种通过工具完成特定目标的对话机制，涉及多个角色的agent协同工作。创建应用时，首先需定义app名称、描述及语言，并选择自动规划模式，该模式能根据需求自动规划任务并分配给相应agent执行。以术语分析app为例，添加了数据科学家和reporter两个内置agent，分别负责从数据库检索排序数据和绘制趋势图。整个过程展示了如何将一个复杂需求拆分为多个步骤，并由不同agent协作完成。此外，平台支持自定义agent，扩展其功能如网络爬虫、数据分析等，以应对更复杂的任务需求。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":392237,"user_name":"AI前沿技术追踪","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2000749,"ip_address":"美国","ucode":"9AF1A1D5466AD5","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1e/87/6d/b4e2656e.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1720352258,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":142628,"content":"非常感谢信任。后期会更新更多好的课程给大家。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1719027,"ctime":1720787438,"ip_address":"山东","comment_id":392237,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_content":"课程通俗易懂，非常好。","like_count":2,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1719027,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1a/3a/f3/106ff941.jpg","nickname":"周文洋","note":"","ucode":"61D85493E804D1","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":647930,"discussion_content":"非常感谢信任。后期会更新更多好的课程给大家。","content_length":22,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1720787438,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"山东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":392742,"user_name":"Geek_4d7e61","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3869532,"ip_address":"天津","ucode":"C249C203D14C30","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1721670973,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_cont